  "description_blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Overview"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "The product contains all the non-3D printed parts for assembling various functional Apex Legends Wingman with Reload Mechanics. To complete the work, you also need to download the Apex Legends Wingman with Reload Mechanics and 3D print the remaining parts."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Creator Program: The Creator Program is a collaborative program between Bambu Lab and creators. Creators unleash their creativity to design 3D printing models, while Bambu Lab provides compatible hardware kits for those designs."
    }
  ],
  "description_html": "<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_padding-in-mobile\">\n<!-- 第一条 -->\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\"><br/></div>\n<h3 class=\"pct_st\">Overview</h3>\n<p class=\"pct_p\">The product contains all the <strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">non-3D printed</strong> parts for assembling various functional <strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Apex Legends Wingman with Reload Mechanics. </strong>To complete the work, you also need to download the <strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Apex Legends Wingman with Reload Mechanics</strong> and  <strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">3D print</strong> the remaining parts.</p>\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\">\n<span data-mce-style=\"text-decoration: underline;\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong><em><span data-mce-style=\"color: #e60034; text-decoration: underline;\" style=\"color: #e60034; text-decoration: underline;\"></span></em></strong></span><br/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\">\n<span data-mce-style=\"text-decoration: underline;\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong><em><span data-mce-style=\"color: #e60034; text-decoration: underline;\" style=\"color: #e60034; text-decoration: underline;\">Creator Program</span><span data-mce-style=\"color: #e60034; text-decoration: underline;\" style=\"color: #e60034; text-decoration: underline;\">:</span></em></strong></span><strong><em> </em></strong>The Creator Program is a collaborative program between Bambu Lab and creators. Creators unleash their creativity to design 3D printing models, while Bambu Lab provides compatible hardware kits for those designs.</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-tb\">\n<table class=\"pct_tb\" data-mce-style=\"width: 99.9987%; height: 125.5px;\" style=\"width: 99.9987%; height: 125.5px;\">\n<!-- 表头 -->\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" data-mce-style=\"height: 19.5833px;\" style=\"height: 19.5833px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" data-mce-style=\"width: 41.9171%; height: 19.5833px;\" style=\"width: 41.9171%; height: 19.5833px;\"><strong> Models</strong></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" data-mce-style=\"width: 12.7413%; height: 19.5833px;\" style=\"width: 12.7413%; height: 19.5833px;\">\n<strong>Creators</strong><br/>\n</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" data-mce-style=\"width: 44.8716%; height: 19.5833px;\" style=\"width: 44.8716%; height: 19.5833px;\"><b>Model Links</b></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" data-mce-style=\"height: 47.1667px;\" style=\"height: 47.1667px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" data-mce-style=\"width: 41.9171%; height: 47.1667px;\" style=\"width: 41.9171%; height: 47.1667px;\">\n<meta content=\"text/html; charset=utf-8\" http-equiv=\"Content-Type\"/>\n<div>\n<div data-line=\"true\" data-line-index=\"0\" data-mce-style=\"text-align: left;\" data-zone-id=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left;\">\n<meta content=\"text/html; charset=utf-8\" http-equiv=\"Content-Type\"/>\n<div>Apex Legends Wingman with Reload Mechanics</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" data-mce-style=\"width: 12.7413%; height: 47.1667px;\" style=\"width: 12.7413%; height: 47.1667px;\"><span>G-Man Projects</span></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" data-mce-style=\"width: 44.8716%; height: 47.1667px;\" style=\"width: 44.8716%; height: 47.1667px;\"><a data-mce-href=\"https://makerworld.com/en/models/487570?from=search#profileId-400386\" href=\"https://makerworld.com/en/models/487570?from=search#profileId-400386\" target=\"_blank\"><strong><span data-mce-style=\"color: #00ae42;\" style=\"color: #00ae42;\">Apex Legends Wingman with Reload Mechanics</span></strong></a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-tb\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<table class=\"pct_tb\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" data-mce-style=\"height: 95px;\" style=\"height: 95px;\">\n<!-- 表头 -->\n<tbody data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" data-mce-style=\"height: 19px;\" style=\"height: 19px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" d